      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but when you mention the \"failure to negotiate a peaceful partition,\" are you referring to the 1947 UN plan? i'm trying to figure out if the main problem was that the partition plan was fundamentally flawed from the start, or if it was just that the parties involved wouldn't cooperate. what's the scholarly consensus on where the real breakdown happened?",
